OL,5,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FSolemn Vespers from Buckfast Abbey
OL,7,     Fon the Feast of St Mary Magdalene,
OL,8,     Fwith music by Scheidemann,
OL,9,     FGuerrero and Martin Baker.
OL,10,G1600 Composer of the Week: Handel
OL,11,     F3/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,12,     FHandel's time with the Duke of
OL,13,     FChandos, where he composed major
OL,14,     Fworks including the Chandos
OL,15,     FAnthems and Acis and Galatea.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FPetroc chats to the Unthanks and
OL,18,     Fintroduces live music from
OL,19,     FFretwork & Ian Bostridge.
