OL,5,G1900 BBC Proms 2026
OL,6,     FLive at the BBC Proms: the BBC
OL,7,     FSymphony Orchestra, conducted by
OL,8,     FSakari Oramo, performs Mahler's
OL,9,     FSymphony No. 6 plus Kurtag's
OL,10,     Fhaunting elegy, Stele, Op.33.
OL,11,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,12,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Feverything in between.
OL,17,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,18,     FBassoonist Joy Guidry returns with
OL,19,     Fa third record selection for 4/4,
OL,20,     Fand Soweto presents more of the
OL,21,     Fbest new releases and jazz
OL,22,     Fclassics.
